## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth Required |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/health` | Health check endpoint | No |
{% if auth_enabled %}
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/register` | Register a new user | No |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/login` | Log in and receive JWT tokens | No |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/refresh` | Refresh access token | No |
{% if include_email_verification %}
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/verify-email` | Verify account with OTP | No |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/resend-otp` | Resend verification OTP | No |
{% endif %}
{% if include_forgot_password %}
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/forgot-password` | Request password reset OTP | No |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/reset-password` | Reset password using OTP | No |
{% endif %}
{% if include_google_oauth %}
| `GET` | `/api/v1/auth/google/url` | Get Google OAuth authorization URL | No |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/auth/google/callback` | Google OAuth callback handler | No |
{% endif %}
| `GET` | `/api/v1/users/me` | Get current authenticated user profile | **Yes (Bearer)** |
| `PATCH` | `/api/v1/users/me` | Update current user profile | **Yes (Bearer)** |
{% endif %}

